From 3d6d8d31144ee1b484f405276d853d83929b2bc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:40:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Harbour Hour: authored first hour on Anker Harbour pier

Presence and craft around the existing tutorial spine (no quest graph,
gate or locked-system changes).

- Arrival: first join shows an ANKER HARBOUR place card after the language
  pick, then the Hub FIND EGON card, two bells rung from Egon's position,
  a green flare over him and his call-out. Items skips its generic title on
  first join; Hub decides its fallback hint at join time (fixes a race that
  cut the arrival short). Returning rookies get a quiet nudge instead.
- Egon attractor: green column over Egon readable across the pier, and a
  one-time "right-click me" line when you walk up.
- Kit ceremony: StarterGearReward builds items as before; StarterKitCeremony
  stages the handoff with per-player ItemDisplays (Egon's hands -> layout ->
  into the player), grants each piece as it lands, auto-equips armour into
  empty slots, and flushes everything on quit/world change/disable. Forager's
  axe gets the same single-piece handoff. Full bag drops leftovers instead
  of deleting them.
- Egon's turn-in lines retimed over the ceremony via the say queue
  (DialogPace), localized.
- Spine ambience: Egon, Forager, Foreman and Miss Ledger get small ambient
  loops in LivingNpcAtmosphere (particles + rare quiet sounds).
- Dialog presence: per-NPC voice blip + speech motes in the NPC's colour on
  every paced line (DialogManager + LivingNpcProfile.say).
- Trail: TutorialQuestTrail keeps its corners; adds per-player painted
  chevrons (BlockDisplay, setTransformationMatrix) near the player with a
  rolling pulse, dust further ahead.
- Copy: harbour gate hints localized (DE), new DE strings, Egon intro line
  updated for the painted trail.
- Spawn discover: small player-only spark ring on unlock.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
